n be getting worse why  would that be why do you think  these whistleblowers feel threatened  they're trying to expose the problems  that you want to hear yeah and we do  want employees that see problems to tell  us about it we will not accept  retaliation so in each of those cases  where there are reports of retaliation  they are investigated and we'll hold  people accountable for that I  established a office of whistleblower  protection that reports directly to me  we've hired whistleblowers who work in  that office so they understand what the  problems the VA have been and they're  helping us now solve those problems and  correct the culture but this is a big  organization and it takes a while to  make these changes so I want people to  understand that we're not declaring the  problems of the VA over we have a lot of  work to do and it's going to take us a  while to correct the problems that have  taken decades to build up within the VA
 

